# patch-package writes and reads its patches with LF. This machine has
# core.autocrlf=true, so without this a fresh Windows clone would get CRLF and
# the patch could fail to apply — which, since #47, means the bot cannot
# connect at all rather than merely losing a macOS convenience. Pin it for both
# hosts (Windows tower + Mac Mini) rather than depend on per-machine git config.
*.patch text eol=lf
